Package: voice2midi
Version: 0.1-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: libclamcore0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamprocessing0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamaudioio0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamvmqt0-dev (>= 0.8)
Maintainer: CLAM development team <clam@iua.upf.es>
Description: voice to MIDI transductor
 voice2midi is an application that allows to transduct human voice
 to a set of MIDI messages (note on/off, velocity, etc.). This is
 achieved by means of using SMS audio analysis algorithms that allow
 to estimate harmonic sounds pitch.
